<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FLAT AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FLAT AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates remained</p>
<p>steady at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Thursday. The</p>
<p>three-month rate stood at 3.20 percent.</p>
<p>				     Sept 19 fix	    Sept 18 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor		     3.11 pct		3.11 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor		     3.15 pct		3.15 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor		     3.20 pct		3.20 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor		     3.36 pct		3.36 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor		     3.47 pct		3.47 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor		    3.58 pct		3.58 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358 - 0 - 680 50 240</p>
</text>
